WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
He still thinks the difference is just salt, what is it?

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,320
It's brain action

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,720
And will you admit that you don't know how to do it?

4
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:10,910
Food, water, fire and salt are all stable

5
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,180
Next, don’t sleep on the floor every day but make a bed first.

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,380
survival information

7
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,020
There is a bamboo camp in the southeast of the orchard.

8
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:22,230
Where are you going to find bamboo?

9
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,310
Can bamboo be eaten?

10
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:25,710
But it can make people live like a human being

11
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,800
You are now more human than us

12
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,960
So why don't you go back and do more work?

13
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,200
Find ways to learn to save fire

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,280
As long as the fire is no longer controlled by him alone

15
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,240
Only this camp has the right to truly discuss rules.

16
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:43,900
Tonight I am

17
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,500
I won’t look at his lighter expression tomorrow morning.
